			"date": "2024-07-03T13:30:02.323Z",
			"content": "<p>oh! eslint has `space-unary-ops` which would have alerted me—wonder if I’m missing that in my config</p><p><a href=\"https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/space-unary-ops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/s</span><span class=\"invisible\">pace-unary-ops</span></a></p><p>(and `space-infix-ops` too! <a href=\"https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/space-infix-ops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/s</span><span class=\"invisible\">pace-infix-ops</span></a>)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
